# 4. Option A — Quick Wazuh Installation

Wazuh's current Quickstart documentation provides an installation assistant for installing the central components on a single host.

Download the assistant:

```bash
curl -sO https://packages.wazuh.com/4.14/wazuh-install.sh
```

Run the quickstart installation:

```bash
sudo bash ./wazuh-install.sh -a
```

The current Wazuh documentation states that this installs the central components and provides the dashboard address and credentials when the installation completes.

