# 14. If the Agent Does Not Connect

Don't panic.

First check:

```bash
sudo systemctl status wazuh-agent
```

Then:

```bash
sudo tail -n 50 /var/ossec/logs/ossec.log
```

Check network connectivity to the manager.

Wazuh documents these default manager ports:

```text
1514/TCP → Agent communication
1515/TCP → Agent enrollment
55000/TCP → Wazuh server API enrollment
```

You can test connectivity with:

```bash
nc -zv <WAZUH_MANAGER_IP> 1514 1515 55000
```

These ports and the connectivity check are documented by Wazuh for enrollment troubleshooting.

