# 26. Investigate Post-Login Activity

After a test login, check the user's activity in your own lab.

Check processes:

```bash
ps aux
```

Check network connections:

```bash
sudo ss -tunap
```

Check sudo activity:

```bash
sudo grep "sudo" /var/log/auth.log | tail
```

Now your investigation becomes:

```text
Authentication
      ↓
User
      ↓
Privilege
      ↓
Process
      ↓
Network
```

This is the same correlation workflow you learned during Days 14–22.

