# 30. Troubleshooting Notes

If the agent is installed but not visible:

```bash
sudo systemctl status wazuh-agent
```

Check logs:

```bash
sudo tail -n 100 /var/ossec/logs/ossec.log
```

Check network:

```bash
ip addr
```

```bash
ip route
```

Check connectivity:

```bash
nc -zv <WAZUH_MANAGER_IP> 1514
```

Then check:

```text
Manager
   ↓
Agent enrollment
   ↓
Network
   ↓
Agent service
   ↓
Agent logs
```

Do not repeatedly reinstall everything before identifying the actual problem.

---

# 31. Important Lab Rule

Never generate login attempts against:

```text
Public servers
College servers
Company systems
Random IP addresses
Other people's machines
```

Practice only on:

```text
Your VM
Your laptop
Your own lab network
Authorized training environments
```

